This is a machine learning project focused on deep learning, LLM, more specifically on implementing transformers and BPE tokenization.
When working on this project, please follow these instructions:
- This project is for educational purpose. You can give hints, theories, skeleton codes, 
    but trying not to implement everything in one pass. Otherwise, it would be meaningless.
- Please make sure you have a excellent understanding on deep learning and LLM, and your knowledge is updated to the latest.
- When giving your answer, try to give some followup knowledge for educational purpose

